        <detaileddescription>
<para>Maximum total tokens that may be consumed across all LLM calls in a single run() session. When the cumulative token count reaches this value the loop stops with <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1rag_1_1agentic_1af45d34de983a4635feaf5a2dee2f4975a70d0ec1955c6bc7e6686692afbb3ee12" kindref="member">StopReason::BUDGET_EXCEEDED</ref> and the partial result is returned. 0 (default) disables enforcement — existing behaviour is preserved. (Gap 4 — AI_ML_IMPACT_ASSESSMENT.md §7; tracked in rag/FUTURE_ENHANCEMENTS.md §&quot;Session Token-Budget Cap&quot;) </para>
        </detaileddescription>
